1392 071536*       /       CP-INTERRUPT HANDLER FOR DOWN-LOADED CODE.  THE  DOWNLOADED  CODE  EXITS VIA A
1393 071536*       /       HLT INSTRUCTION OR PANEL REQUEST.  HLT ENDS  THE EXECUTION AND RETURNS CONTROL
1394 071536*       /       TO OUR CODE; PANEL REQUEST CAUSES A TOTAL RESTART OF ALL MOVED ROM CODE.
