1404 071546* 5365          JMP     HALTEST                 /JUMP IF NOT
1405 071547* 7200          CLA                             /CLEAN UP
1406 071550* 6061          VSF                             /SKIP ON, CLEAR VIDEO INTERRUPT FLAG
