1472 071630*       /       THIS  ROUTINE READS IN TRACK 0, SECTOR 3 INTO CP 15350-16347.  THE FIRST EIGHT
1473 071630*       /       BYTES ARE  VALIDATED AGAINST A KNOWN PATTERN.  ALL ELEMENTS READ IN AS 377 ARE
1474 071630*       /       REPLACED WITH 4000 IN THE RUNNING COPY.
1475 071630*       
1476 071630* 0000  T0S3RD, .-.                             /TRACK 0, SECTOR 3 READ ROUTINE
1477 071631* 1261          TAD     PT0S3BUFF/(T0S3BUFFER-1)/SETUP THE
