1488 071643* 3011          DCA     XR1                     /READ-IN DATA
1489 071644* 1410  LISTLUP,TAD I   XR0                     /GET A TEST VALUE
1490 071645* 7450          SNA                             /END OF LIST?
1491 071646* 5255          JMP     LISTOK                  /JUMP IF SO
1492 071647* 6211          CDF     10                      /GOTO DATA FIELD
1493 071650* 1411          TAD I   XR1                     /COMPARE TO READ-IN VALUE
1494 071651* 6271          CDF     70                      /BACK TO OUR FIELD
1495 071652* 7640          SZA CLA                         /SKIP IF IT MATCHES
1496 071653* 5630          JMP I   T0S3RD                  /TAKE FAILURE RETURN IF NOT
1497 071654* 5244          JMP     LISTLUP                 /KEEP GOING
1498 071655*       
