1773 072172* 5371          JMP     TIMLUP                  /NO, KEEP GOING
1774 072173* 2051          ISZ     T7                      /WAITED TOO LONG?
1775 072174* 5371          JMP     TIMLUP                  /NO, KEEP GOING
1776 072175* 5765          JMP I   TIMOUT                  /YES, RETURN TO CALLER
