4199 075711*       /       MEMORY COMPARE ROUTINE.
4200 075711*       
4201 075711*       /       THIS  ROUTINE  CHECKS IF THE CURRENT TEST FIELD MATCHES THE  TEST  PATTERN  IN
4202 075711*       /       EVERY WORD.  ALL MATCHING WORDS ARE INVERTED FOR THE NEXT TEST.  THE IMMEDIATE
4203 075711*       /       RETURN IS TAKEN ON A MATCH FAILURE; SKIP RETURN IS TAKEN IF ALL WORDS MATCH.
4204 075711*       
4205 075711* 0000  MEMCOMP,.-.                             /MEMORY COMPARE ROUTINE
4206 075712* 1044          TAD     T2                      /GET LATEST FIELD
4207 075713* 0101          AND     Z7/[7]                  /JUST FIELD BITS
4208 075714* 7014          R3L                             /MOVE UP
4209 075715* 1121          TAD     ZCDF/[CDF]              /FORM CDF INSTRUCTION
4210 075716* 3317          DCA     .+1                     /STORE IN-LINE
4211 075717* 7402          HLT+.-.                         /WILL BE CDF XX INSTRUCTION
4212 075720* 1443  MCHKLP, TAD I   T1                      /GET A WORD
4213 075721* 1042          TAD     T0                      /COMPARE TO TEST VALUE
4214 075722* 7001          IAC                             /SHOULD BE ZERO
4215 075723* 7640          SZA CLA                         /SKIP IF IT MATCHES
4216 075724* 5711          JMP I   MEMCOMPARE              /TAKE IMMEDIATE RETURN IF IT FAILS
4217 075725* 1042          TAD     T0                      /GET INVERTED TEST VALUE
4218 075726* 3443          DCA I   T1                      /STORE BACK
4219 075727* 1043          TAD     T1                      /GET ADDRESS
4220 075730* 1041          TAD     TINC                    /BUMP UP
4221 075731* 3043          DCA     T1                      /STORE BACK
4222 075732* 2010          ISZ     XR0                     /DONE ALL IN THIS FIELD
4223 075733* 5320          JMP     MCHKLP                  /NO, GO BACK FOR MORE
4224 075734* 2311          ISZ     MEMCOMPARE              /YES, BUMP RETURN ADDRESS
4225 075735* 5711          JMP I   MEMCOMPARE              /TAKE SKIP RETURN TO CALLER
